{"id":"vod_zy360_65465","vodId":"65465","provider":"zy360","providerName":"360资源","type":2,"name":"假面骑士歌查德[普通话版]","name_cn":"假面骑士歌查德[普通话版]","date":"2023-01-01","year":"2023","region":"jp","area":"日本","platform":"日韩动漫","remarks":"更新至38集","images":{"common":"https://www.imgzy360.com:7788/upload/vod/20241011-1/5a43d47e7c2e90c9531a968e40e7fd1b.jpg"},"summary":"所谓“炼金术”，即通过不同组合产生“金”的技术。人工孕育“生物”的尝试亦作为神秘研究之一，种种实验将在不为人知的现代为舞台展开故事。本故事的关键在于纠合了炼金术中最高技术的产物“人工生命体（怪物）Chemy”，作为被保管在名为“RideChemyCard”的卡牌之中的101个生命体，Chemy为模仿蚱蜢、SL（蒸汽火车）等世上存在的万物所制造。但是，本应被慎重保管着的它们却突然从卡牌中冒出，一齐遭到释放。偶然被卷入该事件的主人公为高中生·一之濑宝太郎，被托付了假面骑士Gotchard的变身腰带“Gotchar驱动器”，与回收散落于世间的Chemy的使命。","rating":{"score":0},"tags":[{"name":"剧情,动作,科幻,日本动漫"}],"sourceType":"third-party","updatedAt":"2024-10-11 10:05:08","episodeCount":38,"playable":true,"playGroups":[{"name":"360zy","episodes":[{"name":"第01话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241008/F7sYcsSU/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第02话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241008/7XwAJdbI/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第03话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241008/nrrwcTcY/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第04话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241008/aJBG7ngz/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第05话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241008/sBeEZ5Ay/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第06话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241008/qvE7PPYL/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第07话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241008/4disjem9/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第08话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241008/O5YkQWof/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第09话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241008/vWTkXFz6/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第10话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241008/pEUc9dcW/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第11话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241008/337T7hnG/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第12话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241008/n6cxurUb/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第13话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241008/P9wZRqkP/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第14话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241008/ChRPn0pE/index.m3u8"},{"name":"第15话","url":"https://vod2.maowushi.com/20241008/F02o